\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  crown flat, seen testing  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  levels.  \b0\par\par\uc2 471 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 November 2003\par 09:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, Nov 20 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Slovak\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  crown\par   opened flat on Thursday, but dealers said the market\par might test the new, lower levels at which they now think the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the crown.\par  \par     The crown was at 40.980/41.010 at 0840 GMT versus the euro\par compared to 40.990/41.000 at Wdnesday's close.\par     The crown retreated from five-and-a-half month highs on\par Wednesday as investors took profits and local companies shopped\par for cheaper foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     Some traders said a near-term direction of the unit remains\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 unclear as sound economic fundamentals and market's belief that  \f28 \par \par \uc2 the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  softened its resistance against crown firming  \par \par \uc2 were largely offset by political uncertainty.  \par \par \uc2 "The power is balanced on both sides... but interest in the  \par \par \uc2 crown still persists so we could test 40.900 (per euro) level,"  \par \par \uc2 said HVB Bank dealer Michal Baranek.  \par \par \uc2 He said the crown could break through the 40.900 mark before  \par \par \uc2 the 2004 state budget draft enters the key parliamentary reading  \par \par \uc2 later this month as some investors might be keen to test the  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sensitivity to crown appreciation.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May to knock the unit  \par \par \uc2 off its record highs of 40.800 per euro, arguing that excessive  \par \par \uc2 firming hurt exporters. The bank also cut 25 basis points from  \par \par \uc2 its interest rates in September to warn speculators.  \par \par \uc2 But some dealers said the budget debate would prevent sharp  \par \par \uc2 crown firming in the near future as the budget vote is seen as  \par \par \uc2 the key test of unity of fragile ruling coalition. The vote on  \par \par \uc2 the budget draft is expected in the first half of next month.  \par \par \uc2 - MARKET SNAPSHOT AT 0745 GMT-  \par \par \uc2 Crown/euro at 40.975/41.000 vs 40.990/41.000 on Wednesday  \par \par \uc2 Crown/dollar at 34.361/412 vs 34.370/400  \par \par \uc2 5-yr yield at 5.318/183 pct vs 5.156/023 pct  \par \par \uc2 10-yr yield at 5.400/330 pct vs 5.330/260 pct  \par \par \uc2 - ((Reporting by Martin Dokoupil; editing by xxx; Reuters  \par \par \uc2 Messaging: martin.dokoupil.reuters.com@reuters.net;  \par \par \uc2 martin.dokoupil@reuters.com, +421-2-5341-8402))  \par \par \uc2 For related prices and rates, Reuters clients can double  \par \par \uc2 click on:   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Crown spot against euro  Against dollar\par Interest rate swap rates  Deposits and forwards\par  \par Contributed cross rates            Benchmark bonds\par Slovak \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fixings\par Govt t-bill auctions               Govt bond auctions\par ------------------RELATED NEWS AND REGIONAL ITEMS---------------\par Slovak news      Slovak diary           Slovak Money news\par Slovak Market Debt                 Slovak \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par Emerging Market Debt               Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 