\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak crown slides, mkt watches for cbank. \b0\par\par\uc2 483 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Januar 2003\par 09:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Jan 23 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown extended its downward spiral at the open on Thursday, one day after shedding around two percent as the flight of speculative capital hit \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the region. \par \par \uc2  The crown lost three-quarters of a percent at the start of the session on heavy crown-selling by London banks and subsequent stop-loss \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and dealers expected the unit to possibly go lower, which they said could possibly trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the crown by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The second day of losses also came after strong statements by Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Marian Jusko, who said on Wednesday the bank would take strong measures to fight foreign speculators who had been pushing the crown stronger in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  "We've weakened from the morning by around 300 basis points. Now the market is only bid. It is too short, and now everyone is waiting for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said CSOB dealer Richard Brza. \par \par \uc2  "Maybe the bank could come somewhere above 43.000." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par --------------- MARKET SNAPSHOT AT 0750 GMT --------------------\par Crown/euro  42.720/780 vs 42.350/450 at Wednesday close\par Crown/dollar  39.870/930 vs 39.480 bid\par 5-yr yield  unchanged at 4.695/563 pct\par 10-yr yield  unchanged at 4.956/894 pct\par ----------------------------------------------------------------\par     On Wednesday, the crown lost around two percent against the\par euro in a general retreat from the region by foreign capital\par after London names booked large losses on the Hungarian forint\par following massive rate cuts and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by that country's\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last week.\par     The crown's slide was briefly halted by comments from \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Slovak\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Treasury Director Frantisek Szulenyi, who said\par possible \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to smoothe turbulence remained an option\par for the bank, but that no decision had yet been made.\par     This was shortly followed, however, by strong statements\par from Governor Marian Jusko, who said he expected to have to\par fight speculators pushing the crown stronger until Slovakia\par joined the ERM II exchange rate mechanism it is required to\par adopt before eurozone entry in around 2008.\par     Jusko also said the bank would protect the crown with bold\par moves such as large interest rate cuts and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the\par firming pressure was too strong, as the bank's chief concern at\par present was whether artificial strengthening could hurt the\par economy.\par     Slovak media also had mixed reports on further developments\par in a weekend row in the ruling coalition after one of its junior\par members, the business-friendly ANO party, complained of the\par secret service gathering information about its activities\par without its knowledge.\par     The left-leaning newspaper Pravda said ANO head Pavol Rusko\par would expect Interior Minister Vladimir Palko to resign if\par investigations showed his ministry had tapped his telephone.\par     But the centrist SME daily cited Rusko as saying he expected\par the conflict to be resolved at a meeting of coalition leaders\par next week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030123dz1n00fqv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
