d\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market selling \par \par \uc2  crowns and slashed interest rates late last year to fend off \par \par \uc2  undesired firming on the unit, which it believes can hurt \par \par \uc2  exports. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030115dz1f00id7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
