\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak cbank says covertly bought euros in Oct. \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 2002\par 13:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, Dec 2 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it conducted covert \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bought hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  from commercial banks in October to halt the rise of the crown. \par \par \uc2  The bank's monetary survey said it bought 30 million euros ($29.8 million) in discrete deals in October when it began to fight the crown's firming. The unit's jump was sparked by the victory of pro-reform parties in September elections. \par \par \uc2  The crown rose by around one percent in October to 41.577 to the euro, its key reference \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  It continued to firm in November, hitting an all-time high of 41.100 early in that month, as foreign funds poured into the central European markets in the expectation of gains once the region joins the eurozone in around 2008. \par \par \uc2  The rally sparked a new series of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's secret hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases, later combined with direct \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The bank had said it bought hundreds of millions of euros in November, but it will reveal the exact volume of that month's hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases in the next monetary survey at the end of December or early in January. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a 150-basis-point interest rate cut on November 15 reversed the crown's rally, and the unit eased to trade at 41.810/890 per euro on Monday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021202dyc200oeo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
