\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 - \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  sends  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  crown lower. \b0\par\par\uc2 713 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 2002\par 12:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Nov 13 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown fell to its lowest levels in almost a month against the euro on Wednesday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken it for the second day in a row. \par \par \uc2  However, the region as a whole got a boost after Moody's on Tuesday lifted its ratings on the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  government bonds of the eight central European EU candidates. The South African rand also found support from a rating outlook upgrade. \par \par \uc2  Local dealers said the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  re-entered the market to sell the crown at 41.47 per euro , sending it down a further half percent against the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The bank later confirmed it had been in the market again and said it was prepared to continue its efforts to knock the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower if it kept on firming. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  yesterday showed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can at least move the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the signs suggest they have been in again today," said one dealer in London. \par \par \uc2  "However, they can probably only smooth the up-trend given all the investment that's likely to come in," he added. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said in the short term the next upside targets in euro/crown were 41.9 and then 42.20. \par \par \uc2  Slovakia has enjoyed a surge of foreign investment after parliamentary elections in late September produced a reformist centre-right coalition government and following Ireland's approval of the Nice Treaty on enlargement in October. \par \par \uc2  At 1045 GMT, the crown traded down 0.51 percent against the euro from late Tuesday levels at 41.76. \par \par \uc2  Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  vice-governor Oldrich Dedek said on Wednesday he thought Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the crown this year had been successful and that he still expected a short-term drop in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dedek said the bank had sold crowns to buy 2.3 billion euros from the open market in this year's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with an additional four billion euros taken directly into its reserves from state coffers from the privatisation of gas importer Transgas. \par \par \uc2  The crown traded down 0.23 percent to the euro at 30.73. \par \par \uc2  MARKETS MULL MOODY'S UPGRADE \par \par \uc2  Moody's took analysts by surprise on Tuesday with an across-the-board foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ratings upgrade for the eight central European EU candidates. \par \par \uc2  Moody's said the move was to bring the ratings into line with local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ratings now that financial integration with the EU is "virtually irreversible". \par \par \uc2  The market response to the upgrades was muted, with the region's main bond markets already seen as overbought, particularly at the long-end of the curve. \par \par \uc2  "In our view, the move is a premature one," said analysts at UBS Warburg, in a research note. \par \par \uc2  UBS said that while few doubt that the EU candidates will eventually become euro zone members, "the lack of certainty means a more gradual convergence between local and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ratings would have been more credible". \par \par \uc2  Moody's adopted a more gradualist approach to Greece's euro membership, even though it was already in the EU, UBS added. \par \par \uc2  However, others were more upbeat saying the move further underlined the attractions of the region as an investment destination. \par \par \uc2  "The Moody's upgrade didn't have much impact in local and external bonds, but it did offer more proof that investment should be headed into emerging Europe, rather than Latin America or Asia," said one dealer at a European bank in London. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the South African rand opened strongly on Wednesday, finding support from S&P's decision the previous day to upgrade the country's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ratings outlook to positive. \par \par \uc2  South African Reserve Bank Governor Tito Mboweni said on Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not struggle to fight against inflation at all costs. \par \par \uc2  His comments hinted at a pause in the tightening cycle, with the bank having hiked rates by 400 basis points this year in an effort to control surging inflation caused by the rand's sharp fall at the end of last year. \par \par \uc2  The bank has missed its three-to-six percent target for the CPIX inflation indicator for 11 months running. \par \par \uc2  The rand eased back later in the session to trade flat around 9.81 per dollar . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113dybd00mdm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
