\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak crown in tight range, mkt eyeing trade data. \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 2002\par 17:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, Oct 28 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown\par  ended little changed on Monday after moving in a narrow\par range during a quiet session as investors awaited the release of\par September trade data, dealers said.\par     The crown closed at 41.530/560 to its key reference\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , from 41.480/530 at Friday's close. It ended at\par 42.290/330 to the dollar after 42.439/534.\par     The crown has traded around 41.500 per euro in the past few\par days, following the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's comments that its recent\par sharp rise was unjustified because of the wide foreign trade gap\par and that it would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the advance continued.\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Slovak\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  unit was trading at an all-time high of\par 41.270/300 per euro prior to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's statements last\par Wednesday.\par     The statistics office is scheduled to release September\par trade data at around 0800 GMT on Tuesday, and the market will\par watch whether the figures confirm the deficit-narrowing trend\par from the previous three months.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     A Reuters survey of analysts earlier this month showed an\par average forecast of a 5.98 billion crown deficit, compared with\par a 6.92 billion gap in September 2001.\par     "If the actual number is close to the forecast, it should be\par already priced in the market and therefore there shouldn't be a\par strong reaction," Slovenska Sporitelna trade Juraj Zabadal said.\par  \par     "I see the crown moving between 41.400-41.700 to euro in the\par next few days."\par     However, dealers said an improvement in the trade gap could\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par see some players try to push the crown higher in order to test\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's resolve to contain the local unit's advance.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021028dyas00vhl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
