500-44.700 \par \par \uc2  per euro on Tuesday, and they do not expect the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to step into the market and prop up the unit even though it \par \par \uc2  trades near last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels from end-June. \par \par \uc2      They added the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the \par \par \uc2  crown weakening if it fell quickly to around 45.000 per euro. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020716dy7g00fgc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
