\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak crown up but seen weak as polls approach. \b0\par\par\uc2 457 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2002\par 10:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, July 12 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  firmed slightly on Friday and was seen following the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  neighbouring Czech unit, but dealers said room for significant \par \par \uc2  strengthening ahead of September 20-21 elections was limited. \par \par \uc2      The market also played down $2.7 billion the government \par \par \uc2  received on Thursday for the sale of a controlling stake in gas \par \par \uc2  monopoly SPP, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has agreed to keep the funds \par \par \uc2  off the market in a special account to avoid rocking the crown. \par \par \uc2      Players said although the crown has weakened to near levels \par \par \uc2  that sparked \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  last month, they did not expect further action by the bank \par \par \uc2  unless there was a sharp move weaker. \par \par \uc2      The crown was trading at 44.579/629 to its key reference \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the euro, at 0745 GMT, from 44.630/670 late on \par \par \uc2  Thursday. It was at 45.090/129 to the dollar, from 45.550/850. \par \par \uc2      "We could be influenced by moves on the euro/Czech. At the \par \par \uc2  moment I think we are in a (easing) channel," said Tatra Banka \par \par \uc2  dealer Boris Somorovsky. \par \par \uc2      "There are more and more signals coming from abroad that the \par \par \uc2  elections will be crucial, so I think at the moment it is not \par \par \uc2  the time to invest in the Slovak crown, because we don't really \par \par \uc2  know what the next government will look like." \par \par \uc2      Foreign investors have approached the crown with caution \par \par \uc2  ahead of the general elections due to worries that autocratic \par \par \uc2  ex-Premier Vladimir Meciar's HZDS party could retake power, \par \par \uc2  which would sink Slovakia's aim of NATO and EU entry. \par \par \uc2      Meciar currently leads opinion polls with around 25 percent \par \par \uc2  support, but he could be blocked from forming a government if \par \par \uc2  other parties -- who have almost unanimously rejected working \par \par \uc2  with him in power -- join together to create a cabinet. \par \par \uc2      Dealers expected the crown to stay in a tight range from \par \par \uc2  44.500-45.850 in the near term, and they did not expect the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  unless the weak support level was \par \par \uc2  broken quickly. \par \par \uc2      "We don't see the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  coming into the market unless \par \par \uc2  we move very quickly towards 45.000 (crowns to the euro)... this \par \par \uc2  may depend on euro/Czech moves," Somorovsky said. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in several rounds last \par \par \uc2  month to support its unit, which was under pressure due to \par \par \uc2  political and macroeconomic risks, starting to buy crowns at \par \par \uc2  around 44.900 per euro and then continuing propping it up at \par \par \uc2  stronger levels. \par \par \uc2      The Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday that it was ready to \par \par \uc2  act to drive its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down from recent record highs. The \par \par \uc2  Czech and Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  often move in tandem. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020712dy7c00gdg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
