\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 - \highlight22\uc2 Slovak intervention \highlight\uc2  buoys crown, zloty dips. \b0\par\par\uc2 554 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 2002\par 11:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, June 18 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown forged higher against the euro on Tuesday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support it for the second day running. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the zloty slipped on market caution ahead of a meeting between the Polish President and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  members to discuss monetary policy, while the Israeli shekel fell after another Palestinian suicide bomb attack. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  National Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the crown on Monday and was in the market again on Tuesday, selling euros around the 44.70 crown level . \par \par \uc2  "We started at around 44.70. I will not say to what level we will continue...(but) we've said we find the 44.50 level as favoured," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Treasury Director Frantisek Szulenyi told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Analysts were sceptical on whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have any more than a short-term impact on the market. "The one thing in (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's) favour is that the crown is not a widely followed or traded market," said one London analyst. \par \par \uc2  That has helped the crown avoid being targeted for attack by speculators, despite Slovakia running large current account and fiscal deficits, the analyst said. \par \par \uc2  However, pressure on the crown is likely to increase as political uncertainty mounts heading into September's national elections. \par \par \uc2  "People going to take it very cautiously ahead of the poll...no-one is going to be getting into the market, while people already there will be hedging," said Michael Every, emerging markets analyst at Royal Bank of Canada. \par \par \uc2  The nationalist HZDS party, led by the autocratic former Prime Minister Vladimir Meciar are currently ahead in the polls ahead of the September vote. \par \par \uc2  At 0935 GMT, the crown traded at 44.4250 to the euro from 44.52 late on Tuesday and at 46.913 to the dollar from 47.17. \par \par \uc2  ZLOTY EASES \par \par \uc2  The zloty drifted lower ahead of a meeting between Polish President Aleksander Kwasniewski and top central bankers at 1330 GMT to discuss the ongoing dispute between the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the government over interest rates and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  Kwasniewski has said he would block any attempt by the leftist government to try and dilute the bank's independence, but has also said he sees room for a further rate cut. \par \par \uc2  Another ultra-benign Polish inflation reading on Monday further increased the pressure on the Monetary Policy Council to cut rates again. \par \par \uc2  Polish consumer prices rose 1.9 percent year-on-year in May - a new post-communist record low and down from three percent in April. "We've seen local corporates pretty active buying euros against the zloty in the past week," said one London trader. \par \par \uc2  "They're not so much worried about a change in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime, but from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or at least stronger words from central bankers." he added. \par \par \uc2  The zloty traded at 3.8276 to the euro from 3.817 and at 4.044 to the dollar from 4.048. \par \par \uc2  The Israeli shekel fell off recent highs against the dollar after a Palestinian suicide bomber blew himself up on a bus in Jerusalem killing at least 17 people. \par \par \uc2  Israeli Prime Minister Ariel Sharon vowed to fight "Palestinian terror" on a visit to the scene. \par \par \uc2  The shekel traded at 4.9320 to the dollar from 4.9240. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020618dy6i00jwq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
