par \uc2  could indicate that the bank did not intend to step into the \par \par \uc2  market. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020411dy4b00g1y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
