 \par \uc2  limited as foreign players were expected to remain cautious \par \par \uc2  ahead of September elections seen crucial to Slovakia's entry \par \par \uc2  into the European Union and NATO. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020409dy4900fqu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
