uc2  respectively, both all-time lows. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the Slovak corporate flows appeared to be well \par \par \uc2  balanced at present, and they predicted the Slovak crown to move \par \par \uc2  in a tight range of 41.65-41.75 for the near future, barring any \par \par \uc2  unexpected large company order. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020408dy4800v0s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
