\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak crown end slightly higher, in tight range. \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 April 2002\par 17:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BRATISLAVA, April 5 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ended a touch higher on Friday but trading activity\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  was light as investors remained cautious after the neighbouring \par \par \uc2  Czech crown was knocked lower by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \par \par \uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  unit stood at 41.69/75 in late trade versus its \par \par \uc2  key \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the euro, from 41.72/76 on Thursday. It was at \par \par \uc2  47.40/47 against the dollar from 47.20/24. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the Slovak crown would probably stick to a \par \par \uc2  tight range after the Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken \par \par \uc2  that country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  the previous session. The Slovak crown \par \par \uc2  had benefited from the Czech unit's recent rapid firming. \par \par \uc2      "Nothing happened really today. The euro/Slovak hovered at \par \par \uc2  41.70-41.75 for the whole session. Just a minimum of interbank \par \par \uc2  trades were matched," said Tatra Banka dealer Boris Somorovsky. \par \par \uc2      "I think that the Slovak market is lacking impulses after \par \par \uc2  the euro/Czech market was stabilised after yesterday's \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I expect us to stay in 41.65-41.90 range in the \par \par \uc2  near term and we'll see what happens." \par \par \uc2      February inflation data, due to be released at around 0700 \par \par \uc2  GMT on Monday, was expected to have little if any impact on the \par \par \uc2  Slovak crown, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      Market players were now awaiting upcoming sales of 49 \par \par \uc2  percent stakes in Slovakia's three regional energy utilities, \par \par \uc2  which are expected to earn the government hundreds of millions \par \par \uc2  of euros. \par \par \uc2      "This is the thing that might bring some potential pressure \par \par \uc2  for crown strengthening, but we aren't sure about the timing of \par \par \uc2  this deal," said Somorovsky. \par \par \uc2      Bids in three separate tenders for the firms are due on \par \par \uc2  April 12 and the state is expected to evaluate the offers early \par \par \uc2  the following week. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020405dy4500uf8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
